  m_Name: DeathPrincessCardEnding
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Card
  Name: Death
  text: "The card falls heavy in your hand, a dark mirror of inevitability.  $You
    failed to produce the visions the king demanded. Your gift, once a spark of hope,
    is now deemed a failure.  $As the wedding unfolds, you are brought forward, not
    as a guest, but as a spectacle. Fire consumes you, the smoke rising through the
    halls of the palace, a grim warning to all who dare defy the king\u2019s will.
    $The Princess watches in silence, horrified. She knows that sooner or later,
    it will be her turn, trapped again with her cruel, unfeeling husband. Every scream,
    every crackling flame, is a promise of the nightmare to come."
  sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5f140a438836405d9bb7eb7e7be325a0, type: 3}
